graph TD
    Idea([Idea / Feature Request]) --> Brainstorm

    Brainstorm[BRAINSTORM & CHALLENGE<br/>Stress-test the idea with AI<br/>Resolve ambiguity early]
    Brainstorm -->|Shared understanding| Spec

    Spec[SPEC IT OUT<br/>AI drafts PRD from context<br/>Human reviews & refines]
    Spec -->|Approved PRD| Break

    Break[BREAK IT DOWN<br/>AI slices PRD into issues<br/>Each issue is self-contained]
    Break -->|Backlog ready| Execute

    Execute[EXECUTE AFK<br/>Agents pick up issues autonomously<br/>Human reviews async]
    Execute --> Ship([Merged PRs])

    Execute -.->|Blocker or failed review| Brainstorm

    style Idea fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff,stroke:#388E3C
    style Brainstorm fill:#FF9800,color:#fff,stroke:#E65100
    style Spec fill:#9C27B0,color:#fff,stroke:#6A1B9A
    style Break fill:#00BCD4,color:#fff,stroke:#00838F
    style Execute fill:#F44336,color:#fff,stroke:#B71C1C
    style Ship fill:#2196F3,color:#fff,stroke:#1565C0
